00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:24.040
CORNELIUS WILLIS: That is
the Titan authentication

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.100
chip that goes on a whole
bunch of Google hardware.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.600
Essentially, every
piece of hardware

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.330
