can be individually identified

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:34.480
in any service using it,
mutually authenticates

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.650
to that hardware.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:40.390
And the Titan chip is one of
the ways we accomplish that.

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:43.234
We were so excited to be
