So Neil showed them
to Urs and they're

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.540
these very cute little things.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.320
And Urs said, ooh, that
could be an earring.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:33.180
And then he looked at me a few
minutes later and said, no.

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:34.640
No, don't do that.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:35.840
No, don't do that.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.570
MARK MANDEL: He knew
where it was going.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:39.861
CORNELIUS WILLIS: And Neal
in the meantime had gone off

00:09:39.861 --> 00:09:41.030
