authenticatable.

00:10:31.734 --> 00:10:32.400
MARK MANDEL: No!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:32.900
No, no.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:33.510
You know what?

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:34.460
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Maybe
you need to press harder.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.650
MARK MANDEL: Well, I'm
not Urs and it's going,

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:41.300
well, I don't know who you are,
