00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:57.860
If we're successful--
and we aren't always,

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.943
but most of the time we
are-- if we can figure out

00:16:59.943 --> 00:17:02.380
how to make something
work, we write it down

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:06.462
because we are easily bored,
three or four times in a row.

00:17:06.462 --> 00:17:07.920
So we write it
down, we publish it.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:11.569
That's all the material that's
at cloud.google.com/solution.

00:17:11.569 --> 00:17:14.170
And that stuff, our
best practices, or step

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.900
by step instructions on
how to move an application

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.940
to the cloud, or how to
back up an application,

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:21.430
or how to build it for
scale, or set up for IoT,

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.800
or do work in media and
entertainment, in oil and gas,

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:24.849
and all over the place.

00:17:24.849 --> 00:17:27.400
So that kind of guidance,
one, gets us out

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.840
